], [222.0, 717.0]], 'i. Purpose: Secondary, long term outcome evaluation', 0.9913661152708764], [[[223.0, 744.0], [448.0, 747.0], [448.0, 778.0], [223.0, 775.0]], 'i. Data Included:', 0.983073213521172], [[[267.0, 811.0], [1068.0, 809.0], [1068.0, 842.0], [267.0, 844.0]], 'a. All data from 1. above (primary data lock) without change and', 0.9879417074844241], [[[268.0, 875.0], [1289.0, 875.0], [1289.0, 908.0], [268.0, 908.0]], 'b.  Neurodevelopmental assessment and respiratory survey at planned 22-26 months', 0.9919252499938012], [[[314.0, 908.0], [484.0, 911.0], [484.0, 945.0], [314.0, 942.0]], 'corrected age.', 0.9999491146632603], [[[179.0, 972.0], [1330.0, 973.0], [1330.0, 1006.0], [179.0, 1005.0]], 'This sequential data lock does not result in an interim analysis, but rather an analysis of each of', 0.9841155301440846], [[[180.0, 1044.0], [1344.0, 1044.0], [1344.0, 1076.0], [180.0, 1076.0]], 'outcomes] being started when the data are complete for that section. In general, no summaries or', 0.9821644152204195], [[[179.0, 1078.0], [1340.0, 1077.0], [1340.0, 1110.0], [179.0, 1111.0]], 'analyses by treatment group will be provided to any study team member for any data prior to the', 0.984517450709092], [[[179.0, 1114.0], [1318.0, 1114.0], [1318.0, 1144.0], [179.0, 1144.0]], 'data being locked. Furthermore, no individuals other than the statisticians at Research Triangle', 0.9910007702807585], [[[179.0, 1147.0], [1329.0, 1148.0], [1329.0, 1178.0], [179.0, 1177.0]], 'Institute (RTI), the DCC for the NRN, will have access to individual treatment assignment until', 0.9841923004702517], [[[179.0, 1182.0], [625.0, 1183.0], [625.0, 1213.0], [179.0, 1212.0]], 'the end of the first stage of data lock.', 0.9910757258534432], [[[180.0, 1245.0], [1343.0, 1244.0], [1343.0, 1277.0], [180.0, 1278.0]], 'Specifically, at the time of the first stage of the data lock, the planned analyses for the associated', 0.9908299650631699], [[[180.0, 1280.0], [1338.0, 1281.0], [1338.0, 1311.0], [180.0, 1310.0]], 'data will be conducted by DCC statisticians and distributed to the study PI, study subcommittee,', 0.991084635257721], [[[178.0, 1314.0], [1298.0, 1313.0], [1298.0, 1346.0], [178.0, 1347.0]], 'and NICHD. At this point, these study team members may become unmasked with treatment', 0.9980408191680908], [[[178.0, 1348.0], [1297.0, 1345.0], [1297.0, 1381.0], [178.0, 1384.0]], 'assignment for individual study subjects. However, the Follow up investigators who conduct', 0.9896671308411492], [[[178.0, 1383.0], [1329.0, 1381.0], [1329.0, 1414.0], [178.0, 1416.0]], 'neuro-developmental assessments at the two-year follow-up, the clinical staff, and families will', 0.9981952682137489], [[[178.0, 1420.0], [1251.0, 1420.0], [1251.0, 1449.0], [178.0, 1449.0]], 'remain masked as to study drug assignment of individual subjects throughout this period.', 0.9964107403701002], [[[178.0, 1451.0], [1327.0, 1453.0], [1327.0, 1486.0], [178.0, 1484.0]], 'Accordingly, while summary results may be distributed to larger audiences at this time (e.g., as', 0.9966263187428316], [[[178.0, 1522.0], [1321.0, 1522.0], [1321.0, 1555.0], [178.0, 1555.0]], 'that would be accessible to Follow up investigators, clinical staff or families would not include', 0.9796211848553923], [[[179.0, 1556.0], [1000.0, 1557.0], [1000.0, 1590.0], [179.0, 1589.0]], 'any information that could unmask individual treatment assignment.', 0.9973175083145951], [[[180.0, 1621.0], [1354.0, 1621.0], [1354.0, 1654.0], [180.0, 1654.0]], 'After the completion of the final stage of database lock, Follow-up investigators and clinical staff', 0.9820368671417237], [[[181.0, 1658.0], [981.0, 1658.0], [981.0, 1688.0], [181.0, 1688.0]], 'may be unmasked to individual treatment assignment, if requested.', 0.9963855330760663], [[[181.0, 1720.0], [1336.0, 1720.0], [1336.0, 1752.0], [181.0, 1752.0]], 'Any deviations from this plan will be discussed in the study report. For example, this report will', 0.9923227769987923], [[